myos initramfs

Everything in the initramfs/ directory of the source tree ends up here.
`make` packs it into build/initramfs.tar (USTAR), Limine loads that as a
module (module_path: in limine.conf), and the kernel unpacks it into the
tmpfs mounted on / before the shell starts.

Try: ls /, ls /etc, cat /etc/motd, ls /dev, stat /dev/null
